        "created_at": "2014-08-13T23:52:26.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Do innate powers count as being \"Active?\"</p><p>Specifically, can I use Tachyon's innate \"nimble strike\" in combination with the Hypersonic assault?</p><p>If not, what are people who don't get the promo \"sucker punch\" supposed to do?</p>",
